    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto Jurassic Knights is a turn-based auto battler where you draft a team of knights and dinosaurs armed with guns. Position your units, stack synergies, and watch battles unfold automatically. Each round challenges you to adapt and evolve your strategy as you unlock new tiers of units and build toward an unstoppable force. It's fast, strategic, and endlessly replayable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882680/extras/3f0a44888174984d226d88d85e372a02.avif?t=1753664512\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882680/extras/9c4871810b249dd6ceb7d6236db08c22.avif?t=1753664512\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882680/extras/20f881471c46d5a0b9c6bb3d0eed326c.avif?t=1753664512\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882680/extras/b5732009f412915b14c44f40c32fe66f.avif?t=1753664512\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
